{"id":"5a9f42708ce20d55","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-sub-regular.md","title":"thm-subobject-fibration-regular","display":"thm-subobject-fibration-regular","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-sub-regular","aliases":["16-thm-sub-regular","16-thm--sub-regular"],"display":"thm-subobject-fibration-regular","depends_on":["[[16-df-regular-category]]","[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-19","source":"Theorem4.4.4(i),(v) and proof pp.258–260 (PDF278–280)"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-sub-regular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-sub-regular</span><span>16-thm--sub-regular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-subobject-fibration-regular"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem4.4.4(i),(v) and proof pp.258–260 (PDF278–280)"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (具有有限极限的范畴)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span> 简写 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a> 中按单态射同构类构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}\\)</span> 在本页简写该处的规范投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\">\\(p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\)</span>，并采用该处同一分裂选择。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8727007e6f227c84\" href=\"?note=8727007e6f227c84\" title=\"16-df-regular-category\">16-df-regular-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a15697ec1bc8115\" href=\"?note=6a15697ec1bc8115\" title=\"16-df-regular-fibration\">16-df-regular-fibration</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源为Theorem4.4.4(i),(v)及证明，pp.258–260（PDF278–280）。正向取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_u[m]=[\\operatorname{Im}(um)]\">\\(\\Sigma_u[m]=[\\operatorname{Im}(um)]\\)</span>；像的最小性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*\">\\(\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*\\)</span>，像稳定性给BC，拉回粘贴给Frobenius。子对象已具纤维有限积和等式，所以是正则纤维化。</li>\n<li>反向，单态射上的左伴随是复合；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 分解为图单态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\">\\(\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\rightarrowtail J\\times I\\)</span> 后接积投影，故简单存在量词扩展成一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_u\">\\(\\Sigma_u\\)</span> 并满足BC。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(u)=\\Sigma_u[\\operatorname{id}_I]\">\\(m(u)=\\Sigma_u[\\operatorname{id}_I]\\)</span>；伴随单位使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(u)\">\\(m(u)\\)</span> 分解，任何其他单因子通过转置大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(u)\">\\(m(u)\\)</span>，所以它是像。BC给该像拉回稳定，得到正则性。已核对这一来源证明；本页不把只给量词名字视为证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)$ 简写 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]] 中按单态射同构类构造的 $\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)$；$\\operatorname{cod}$ 在本页简写该处的规范投影 $p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}$，并采用该处同一分裂选择。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-category","status":"resolved","id":"8727007e6f227c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$、$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-regular-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-regular-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$、$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-regular-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegCat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\operatorname{Sub}(\\mathcal B)\\to\\mathcal B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_u[m]=[\\operatorname{Im}(um)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\rightarrowtail J\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_u","display":false},{"tex":"m(u)=\\Sigma_u[\\operatorname{id}_I]","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"m(u)","display":false},{"tex":"m(u)","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-455","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-sub-regular|thm-subobject-fibration-regular]]"}],"outgoing":["8727007e6f227c84","6a15697ec1bc8115","6c23c06c4d297e8d"]}